id: F11
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feMul: reduction-by-p coefficient swapped, 'let b1_19 = 19 * b1' -> '... = 18 * b1' (the schoolbook-multiply reduction constant, not the carry-propagation tail feMul shares with feSq).
====OLD====
  let b1_19 = 19 * b1; let b2_19 = 19 * b2; let b3_19 = 19 * b3
====NEW====
  let b1_19 = 18 * b1; let b2_19 = 19 * b2; let b3_19 = 19 * b3
====END====
